            compared under the Story Plan matrix.
            No candidate event is inferred and no second interpreter is introduced.
            Run live model parity cases; expected: all declared deterministic fields match.

    T512
        title        Inert branded behavior gateway
        status       open
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@T506, @T507, @task.Rewrite.T103, @task.Rewrite.T104]
        derives_from [
                     @plan.StoriesAndModels.O6,
                     @plan.StoriesAndModels.V6,
                     @plan.StoriesAndModels.C1,
                     @plan.CommandLineV2.O1,
                     @plan.CommandLineV2.D1
                     ]
        satisfies    [@plan.StoriesAndModels.O6]
        description
            Deliverable: one inert branded gateway registers a supplied App and exact external
            Story IDs.
            Allowed writes: packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/testing/gateway/** and co-located tests.
            Evidence: brand, identity, invalid-registration, and no-acquisition receipts;
            evidence/T512.md.
            1. Validate nonempty unique IDs, exact App identity, and accepted App/machine Story
            membership.
            2. Keep gateway internals private and registration synchronous.
            3. Prove registration acquires no Runtime, Implementation, actor, fixture, sink, or
            executor.
            Prerequisites: P1 closed App graph/Implementation closure and T506/T507 Story
            constructors.
            Shared-write boundary: T512 owns the gateway brand; T513 consumes it without a second
            validator.
        acceptance
            Valid records retain exactly one supplied App and external-ID mapping.
            Empty/duplicate IDs, missing/mixed Apps, recipes, foreign machines, and incompatible
            Stories reject.
            Lookalikes fail branding; valid and invalid registration acquire no Runtime, services,
            fixture,
            actor, sink, executor, or cleanup.
            Run gateway tests and packed type consumers; expected: accepted identity only, with no
            effects.

    T513
        title        CLI grammar and trusted gateway loading
        status       open
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@T512, @task.Rewrite.T108]
        derives_from [
                     @plan.CommandLineV2.O1,
                     @plan.CommandLineV2.V1,
                     @plan.CommandLineV2.D1,
