        description
            Deliverable: one observable Stage 5 exit record over browser, isolated consumer, live
            Story/model,
            installed CLI, proving-app, output, signal, and exit evidence.
            Allowed writes: workflow/tasks/Rewrite/evidence/T517.md only; fixes return
            to owner
            Tasks. Do not duplicate production proof implementations.
            Evidence: exact commands, package revision, host/browser versions, and owner Task
            receipts.
            1. Check Task edges against ProjectDelivery stages and confirm no ownership cycle.
            2. Run the Stage 5 browser/isolated-consumer, Story/model parity, and installed binary
            gates after their owner receipts exist.
            3. Record pass/fail/inconclusive per Verification target and retain unresolved local
            questions.
            Prerequisite rationale: this is the sole P5 integration exit gate; component Tasks
            remain free
            to progress from their actual prerequisites. P6 consumer applications and final cutover
            remain separately owned.
            Shared-write boundary: this Task writes evidence only; no source owner or acceptance is
            duplicated.
        acceptance
            Verify the complete candidate coverage and graph: every outcome in the 13 new 
            capability Plans has a mapped owner Task; every Verification target is assigned an 
            owner Task or explicitly deferred; semantic Plan links are not treated as execution 
            blockers; all blockers express executable prerequisites; and the six-stage prerequisite 
            graph is acyclic. Inspect the recorded ProjectDelivery and capability Plan/Task 
            records; verify owner mappings, distinguish semantic owner links from executable 
            blockers, and record the exact Plan/Task artifact checksums with the coverage and DAG 
            receipt in evidence/T517.md. React 18/19 and browser checks pass on package routes with 
            no cross-Runtime ownership. SSR/request proofs show abandoned render does no work, 
            committed attachment drains once, and requests remain isolated. For ReactAndHosts 
            O4/V4, prove runPromiseExit preserves typed failure and complete Cause; foreign Promise 
            rejection/abort is adapted once; stale, foreign, and revoked construction-scoped writes 
            fail before store mutation/publication; valid writes are accepted; Scope close revokes 
            authority and waits for cleanup while retaining terminal failure truth. Live 
            Story/model final and prefix parity passes with exact bounded evidence. Fresh installed 
            CLI success, malformed input, cleanup failure, SIGINT/SIGTERM, output, and exit cases 
            pass; P6 consumer Tasks retain their own application receipts. Record 
            pass/fail/inconclusive for each mapped Verification target and name any still-open 
            local Question; do not claim unresolved clauses passed. Run the recorded coverage/DAG 
            and focused P5 gate commands; expected: every settled Stage 5 clause passes or is 
            explicitly deferred to a named open Question.

